From: "lich.wang" <lich.wang@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 06:07:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: backlight: sy7758: add silergy,follower

A chip that only mirrors the brightness of the primary SY7758 of the
same panel and owns no backlight device.
---
 .../bindings/leds/backlight/silergy,sy7758.yaml           | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/silergy,sy7758.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/silergy,sy7758.yaml
index bf1d9c2b8..4cb1164b5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/silergy,sy7758.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/backlight/silergy,sy7758.yaml
@@ -28,6 +28,14 @@ properties:
   enable-gpios:
     maxItems: 1
 
+  silergy,follower:
+    description:
+      The chip does not own a backlight device of its own.  It only mirrors
+      the brightness programmed on the primary (non-follower) SY7758 of the
+      same panel, so that a backlight split across two chips stays uniform.
+      Boards using this do not need a second backlight device.
+    type: boolean
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
